Description: FlickOS kit: Young Learners, apps for children
 Learning apps for school and home from Debian: GCompris (activities for
 ages 2 to 10), Kalzium (the periodic table), KGeography, KTurtle
 (programming for children) and KMPlot (graphs of functions).
 .
 A kit is installed from Software and removed there too. Nothing it
 installs runs until it is used (docs/design/flickos-dev.md, Q15).
